7904671d6c753ce87271de18a664e, https://si.imgix.net/5e29d979/uploads/origins/3475bed3-299c-4c26-a3d9-04fe6f610f9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=07eebdc389ba048da90547cccbf63b33 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5e29d979/uploads/origins/3475bed3-299c-4c26-a3d9-04fe6f610f9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc7a4fcc204f45344a2418a277bca025 3x"}, "body": "Please can I request an image in which Captain Marvel is defeated.\n\nCaptain Marvel is in this outfit: https://external-content.duckduckgo.com/iu/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fassets-prd.ignimgs.com%2F2023%2F06%2F16%2Fcapt-marvel-design-1686947856816.jpg&f=1&nofb=1&ipt=662f218c7f090351fa8b6d12acab546e59e5e83cf035b30d03452f9b5c581e8b\n\nShe is kneeling down, as though submitting to defeat.\n\nOne of her arms has been severed at the elbow.\n\nA slash across her throat is the finishing blow.\n\nShe already has a large number of knives, daggers, darts and other sharp objects embedded in her - both in the front and back (none of them are in her face or head, however).\n\nThere are knives already stabbed into her ass, one of her breasts and her vagina.\n\nThank you!", "nc": 40, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@scar4552/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2618626, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc5dd4ac/uploads/origins/5dc52d83-d1fe-4910-ba8f-78b09300eccd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f524987cbce1951fb7dc28f0924d8ed2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bc5dd4ac/uploads/origins/5dc52d83-d1fe-4910-ba8f-78b09300eccd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f524987cbce1951fb7dc28f0924d8ed2, https://si.imgix.net/bc5dd4ac/uploads/origins/5dc52d83-d1fe-4910-ba8f-78b09300eccd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2